  "translation": "Na man bilong wok wantaim ⟨em⟩ i tok: Wanem, mi ken putim dispela long fes bilong wan handet man? Na ⟨em⟩ i tok: Givim long ol man, bilong ol kaikai, long wanem Yahwe i tok olsem: Ol bai kaikai, na samting bai i stap hap.",
